---
import Base from "../layouts/Base.astro";
import AgentExperience from "../islands/AgentExperience";
import ClosingCTA from "../components/ClosingCTA.astro";
---
<Base title="Inbound Call Solutions | CPL Voice Delivery" description="Routine inbound questions, qualification, configured routing, and useful post-call information. CPL configures, tests, and manages AI voice agents for your business." jsonLd={{'@context':'https://schema.org','@type':'Service',name:'CPL AI Voice Agents',serviceType:'AI voice agent implementation and management',provider:{'@type':'Organization',name:'Cyber Pirate Labs, LLC'}}}>
 <section class="service-intro"><div class="wrap service-intro-grid"><div><p class="eyebrow">CPL AI Voice Agents</p><h1>Give the next caller<br /><span>a clear next step.</span></h1><p class="hero-summary">An inbound voice agent that answers from approved business information, asks useful questions, and keeps the request moving within the rules you set.</p><a class="button" href="/demo/?interest=voice">Request a CPL Demo ↗</a></div><div class="service-note"><span>THE PHONE RINGS.</span><blockquote>“We’re planning a bathroom remodel in Carmel.”</blockquote><p>Project type. Location. Desired timing. Useful context for the team’s follow-up.</p><small>FICTIONAL REQUEST · NO QUOTE OR BOOKING</small></div></div></section>
 <section class="experience-section"><div class="wrap"><div class="section-heading"><div><p class="eyebrow">Explore a voice conversation</p><h2>A useful inquiry.<br />Before the follow-up.</h2></div><p>Follow the sample caller from greeting to organized details. This is a transcript walkthrough with no audio.</p></div><AgentExperience client:visible initialMode="voice" /></div></section>
 <section class="wrap service-details"><div><p class="eyebrow">Configured for your inbound calls</p><h2>Helpful where it can be.<br />Clear when it needs a person.</h2></div><div class="detail-list"><article><h3>Routine business answers</h3><p>Services, business hours, service areas, and frequently asked questions from information you approve.</p></article><article><h3>Useful qualification</h3><p>Ask the right follow-up questions and capture the details your team needs to review an inquiry.</p></article><article><h3>After-hours automated coverage</h3><p>A configured agent can handle approved routine inquiries outside your normal hours. Human follow-up and response arrangements are scoped separately.</p></article><article><h3>Configured routing &amp; post-call summaries</h3><p>Follow agreed rules for routing a request and organizing information for a supported business destination. Transfers and delivery connections depend on the implementation.</p></article></div></section>
 <section class="scope-band"><div class="wrap"><p class="eyebrow">The setup matters</p><h2>Your phone. Your boundaries.</h2><p>Phone setup, number requirements, transfers, recording and consent notices, supported integrations, and usage are assessed for your particular scope. We test routine calls, incomplete requests, unknown answers, and situations that need a person.</p><p>CPL chooses the platform and supported connections around your needs, phone setup and existing systems. Stammer AI is an option when it fits the agreed scope. The website walkthrough is local sample data; it is not a live phone agent.</p></div></section><ClosingCTA title="Let’s hear what your business needs." text="Bring the questions your callers ask. We’ll discuss an inbound voice setup around your information, workflow, and approved next steps." />
</Base>
